# End-to-end run configuration (ADR 0032). Committed on purpose, so the harness
# and CI share one source — and safe to, because no secret lives here: the
# serving port and its URL are owned by playwright.config.ts, and
# BETTER_AUTH_SECRET is minted per run (an e2e session is thrown away with its
# database).
#
# DATABASE_URL points at the disposable Postgres from compose.e2e.yaml (dev-only
# credentials, like .env.example). CI overrides it to the workflow's Postgres
# service.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://wikioui:wikioui@localhost:5433/wikioui_e2e"
